# Line endings are content here, not presentation.
#
# `gleam format --check` compares bytes, so a checkout that rewrote LF to CRLF
# reports every file in the repository as misformatted. That is what Windows
# runners do by default, and it is what happened the first time this repository
# ran CI at all: one job failed with a list of every source file in it, which
# reads like a catastrophe and is a checkout setting.
#
# Normalising here rather than asking each contributor and each runner to set
# core.autocrlf keeps the formatter's answer the same everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
